        <key>caseBoundary</key>
        <string>The real formal capital is absent from the frozen cmap. This unit proposes only the actual lowercase smcp target and does not invent, encode or alias a capital input.</string>
        <key>construction</key>
        <string>Use the existing genuine same-cut small-cap body in the orientation required by the actual formal case pair. Turning preserves its complete native curves and stroke weights; reflection is within the actual genuine italic axis. No whole capital reduction, upright-to-italic synthesis or new donor. Opposite source edge-spacing roles are retained with one whole translation and an adjusted advance.</string>
